Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: Undo function `undo_mutate` returns `Int`, but rollback functions must return Unit
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/transact_ffi_undo_rejects_non_unit_return.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     #Undo(undo_mutate) mutate: fn(left: Int, right: Int) -> Int = "std::cmp::max"
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Rollback invokes the inverse for its side effect and cannot use a returned value
 Fix: Remove `Int` from `undo_mutate` so it returns Unit
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
